+rationale = "A participating host writer must revoke future content use and wait for affected active users before changing bytes. Unrelated physical pages are not revoked or drained. Captured code content is activated only inside its exact kernel running scope. This is not proof of private RX admission, hardware-write mediation, executable publication, or linked native execution."
+
+[bindings]
